   "Broader macro slowdown in construction, automotive, or industrial production.",
   "Regulatory hurdles regarding anti-trust in China, Europe, and global marine/protective coatings markets.",
   "Complexity of business separation between Nippon Paint and Sherwin-Williams.",
   "Rebound in raw material costs.",
   "Execution risk on cost management and restructuring efforts."
  ],
  "charts": [
